    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88952" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεδρ-εία</span></b> , or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεδρ-εδρία</span></b>  (required by metre in <i><span class="en">
			E.
			<u>Or.</u>
			93
		</span></i> and found in Pap. of <i><span class="en">
			Phld.
		</span></i> (v. infr.), but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εία</span>
		<u>PTeb.</u> (v. infr.)), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sitting by</i> or <i>near</i>:
			esp., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>besieging, blockade</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.126
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				36.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>close attention to</i> a thing, <i>assiduity,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				24.39
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.232
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Plot.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; esp. <i>sitting by a sick-bed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				304
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τῶν τέκνων π</span>.
				<i>attentions</i> paid by them, <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				p.58A.
			</span></i></div>
